{"name": "Hyper Sentinel Fusion", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TEAR DOWN SPACE TITANS\u00a0</strong>\u27a1\ufe0f<strong> LAND &amp; INFILTRATE\u00a0</strong>\u27a1\ufe0f<strong> RAID RESOURCES\u00a0</strong>\u27a1\ufe0f<strong> UPGRADE &amp; DOMINATE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/b13607713136a5aee17b95e291228c08.poster.avif?t=1785777845\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/b13607713136a5aee17b95e291228c08.webm?t=1785777845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/b13607713136a5aee17b95e291228c08.mp4?t=1785777845\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outflank the enemy in your nimble Sentinel starfighter to tear down the defences of alien megastructures while under fire. When the self-destruct sequence is initiated, you can land on the deck and infiltrate with your remote Hyper Droid, to plunder the depths and pull off a high-stakes heist from within. Escape before everything explodes, and then spend your bounty on augments and upgrades for both your Sentinel and your Hyper Droid, before returning to battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TEAR DOWN SPACE TITANS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pilot an agile star fighter across the surface of colossal, procedurally-generated alien megastructures. Harness the silky smooth controls to dog-fight, dodge and destroy the surface defences, allowing you to land and infiltrate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/464a9f930c0dcbd4a5d0c846df1ab583.poster.avif?t=1785777845\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/464a9f930c0dcbd4a5d0c846df1ab583.webm?t=1785777845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/464a9f930c0dcbd4a5d0c846df1ab583.mp4?t=1785777845\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLUNDER FROM WITHIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy your Hyper Droid to pull off a high-stakes heist from within, as you hunt down the Mother-Brain to secure powerful upgrade pods. Steal your enemies form and weapons to turn their abilities against them, then ram raid everything to capture valuable resources and escape before the whole place goes boom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/113e966226fcc753434649ae082b43c4.poster.avif?t=1785777845\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/113e966226fcc753434649ae082b43c4.webm?t=1785777845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/113e966226fcc753434649ae082b43c4.mp4?t=1785777845\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UPGRADE &amp; EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you fall in battle, time rewinds, sending you back to Moonbase Alpha - your hub for reinvention. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/3c0d1084c69549d5db7ee99825b3f1ff.poster.avif?t=1785777845\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/3c0d1084c69549d5db7ee99825b3f1ff.webm?t=1785777845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/3c0d1084c69549d5db7ee99825b3f1ff.mp4?t=1785777845\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend your hard-earned currency on game-changing upgrades that permanently enhance your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/ffa419feb35929e33222e8e33c18304c.poster.avif?t=1785777845\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/ffa419feb35929e33222e8e33c18304c.webm?t=1785777845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/ffa419feb35929e33222e8e33c18304c.mp4?t=1785777845\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you are ready, launch back into battle fully upgraded and equipped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/f34d5b77be70a9732510eac73142c995.poster.avif?t=1785777845\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/f34d5b77be70a9732510eac73142c995.webm?t=1785777845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/f34d5b77be70a9732510eac73142c995.mp4?t=1785777845\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"1920\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/extras/1e639d421512882b1f5f1c1e58d5189d.avif?t=1785777845\" width=\"1060\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Pilot an agile starfighter to tear down alien megastructures under fire, then pull off a high-stakes heist from within before everything explodes. When you die time rewinds, sending you back to Moonbase Alpha - your hub for reinvention. Spend your bounty on epic upgrades, ready for the next run.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563010/b04ff5272870042bdac7a584dc4714eed468e3c8/header.jpg?t=1785777845", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Shoot 'Em Up", "Top-Down Shooter", "Twin Stick Shooter", "Roguelite", "Perma Death"], "developers": "Four5Six Pixel, Huey Games", "publishers": "Four5Six Pixel, Huey Games", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2563010", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "30 June 2025 - Request Access\n\n1 July 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/jF1D51n0czo", "first_seen": 1751241600.0, "review_rank": 1567}